### Pré-visualização de ambiente com IA
### Requer uma foto real do ambiente e, opcionalmente, uma planta baixa marcada em azul.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@jwtToken = COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI
@workspaceId = 1

### Foto + planta baixa marcada
POST {{host}}/api/v1/environment-previews
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-Workspace-Id: {{workspaceId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=genia-boundary

--genia-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="rawImage"; filename="sala-atual.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./samples/sala-atual.jpg
--genia-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="floorPlan"; filename="planta-sala-marcada.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./samples/planta-sala-marcada.png
--genia-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="options"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "environment": "LIVING_ROOM",
  "style": "MODERN",
  "colors": ["OFF_WHITE", "NATURAL_WOOD", "LIGHT_GRAY"],
  "lighting": "WARM_INDIRECT",
  "flooring": "LIGHT_PORCELAIN",
  "generationMode": "PREVIEW",
  "additionalInstructions": "Adicionar painel ripado atrás da televisão"
}
--genia-boundary--

### Somente foto
POST {{host}}/api/v1/environment-previews
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-Workspace-Id: {{workspaceId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=photo-only-boundary

--photo-only-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="rawImage"; filename="quarto-atual.webp"
Content-Type: image/webp

< ./samples/quarto-atual.webp
--photo-only-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="options"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "environment": "BEDROOM",
  "style": "MINIMALIST",
  "colors": ["WHITE", "BEIGE", "NATURAL_WOOD"],
  "lighting": "NATURAL",
  "flooring": "LAMINATE",
  "generationMode": "PREVIEW",
  "additionalInstructions": "Manter a janela e criar armário planejado"
}
--photo-only-boundary--
